<h1><span lang="EN-GB">PC Related Problems - Hardware</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<h2>Processor Related</h2>
<p><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB">System Speed Too Slow error message:</span> If this error message appears during scanning, it means there is insufficient CPU time available for KUBE to scan.</b></p>
<p class="whs4"><span lang="EN-GB"><b>Solution:</b></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Check the processor specification in <a href="../pc_requirements.htm">PC Requirements</a> document is sufficient and ensure that no other programs are interfering with KUBE.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
